# Docker reads this from the build context root, which is the repository root
# (see docker-compose.yml), so it has to cover every folder.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist

# Never bake secrets into an image layer. Real values arrive at run time through
# docker-compose `env_file`.
**/.env
**/.env.local

.git
.claude
.agents
.scratch
frontend
docs
*.md
**/*.tsbuildinfo
